        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sugarmill_Woods%2C_Florida",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The community’s name and layout echo a rich lore of Florida and American history that shaped the modern villages.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://sugarmillcivic.org/wordpress/history-of-sugarmill-woods/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Ruins of Yulee’s 19th‑century sugar mill, including stone walls and a boiler, now form a State Historic Site in nearby Homosassa.",
